& [CommandContract] is one local PowerShell entry point
  + [BWV-001] action is exactly test or clippy
  + [BWV-002] default behavior emits one JSON plan and invokes neither WSL nor Cargo
  + [BWV-003] Execute is the sole switch that admits the selected WSL Cargo lane
  + [BWV-004] repository root is derived from the script location and must contain Cargo.toml
  + [BWV-005] target is one caller-visible absolute WSL home path containing only conservative path characters
  + [BWV-006] distribution is passed as a process argument and not interpolated into the Bash program

& [CapacityAndReuse]
  + [BWV-007] inspect free bytes on the Windows volume containing the repository
  + [BWV-008] compare free bytes with a caller-visible minimum GiB threshold before WSL execution
  + [BWV-009] refuse insufficient capacity with no cleanup or child launch
  + [BWV-010] default target is /home/pinky/.cache/cantor-workspace-verification
  + [BWV-011] set CARGO_BUILD_JOBS to one and tests to one thread
  + [BWV-012] use one stable target and stable temporary directory across invocations

& [Execution]
  + [BWV-013] test runs cargo test workspace all-features locked no-fail-fast quiet with one test thread
  + [BWV-014] clippy runs warnings-denied cargo clippy workspace all-targets all-features locked quiet
  + [BWV-015] child failure returns a nonzero wrapper status and preserves the exact child status in fault detail
  + [BWV-016] plan declares empty remote_hosts and destructive_actions collections

& [IdentityBoundary]
  + [BWV-017] no command contacts EVO-X2 SSH SCP SFTP rsync network shares or any remote host
  + [BWV-018] no command reads writes pauses resumes or configures OneDrive
  + [BWV-019] no command deletes targets caches artifacts sources or evidence
  + [BWV-020] this tool is development verification policy and has no Cantor runtime or SOP authorization power

& [Acceptance]
  + [BWV-A01] default plan is valid JSON and reports execute false
  + [BWV-A02] explicit plan reports the closed action stable target serialization and empty remote and destructive sets
  + [BWV-A03] impossible free-space threshold refuses with a nonzero exit and no WSL launch
  + [BWV-A04] invalid action or target refuses before plan admission
  + [BWV-A05] script passes PowerShell parsing and repository diff checks

